      "html": "<div class=\"ds-example\"><section class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-muted\">API 等价费用</div><div class=\"ds-metric\">—</div><div class=\"ds-muted\">按当前模型价格</div></section></div>",
      "css": ".ds-example{display:inline-block;background:#101012;color:#F0F0F3;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei UI','Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:13px;}.ds-card{background:#1B1B1F;border:none;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;width:230px;display:grid;gap:9px}.ds-muted{color:#AFB0BA}.ds-metric{font-size:29px;font-weight:500}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Subscription quota gauges",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "quota-meter",
      "description": "Two native blue half-ring meters with up to 200 px diameter, 9 px strokes and 34 px values; warning ink is reserved for low quota. Dates include the Chinese weekday. This panel uses illustrative values; overview uses compact bars.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-example\"><div class=\"ds-gauges\" aria-label=\"额度仪表示例\"><section class=\"ds-gauge\"><div class=\"ds-gauge-title\">5 小时额度 · 示例</div><svg class=\"ds-arc\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 116\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-track\" d=\"M10 110 A100 100 0 0 1 210 110\"/><path class=\"ds-fill\" d=\"M10 110 A100 100 0 0 1 210 110\" pathLength=\"100\" stroke-dasharray=\"72 100\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-gauge-value\">72%<small>剩余</small></div><div class=\"ds-gauge-reset\">重置 9月16日 周三 16:03</div></section><section class=\"ds-gauge\"><div class=\"ds-gauge-title\">本周额度 · 示例</div><svg class=\"ds-arc\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 116\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-track\" d=\"M10 110 A100 100 0 0 1 210 110\"/><path class=\"ds-fill\" d=\"M10 110 A100 100 0 0 1 210 110\" pathLength=\"100\" stroke-dasharray=\"62 100\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-gauge-value\">62%<small>剩余</small></div><div class=\"ds-gauge-reset\">重置 9月16日 周三 16:03</div></section></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-example{display:inline-block;background:#101012;color:#F0F0F3;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei UI','Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:13px;}.ds-gauges{display:flex;gap:16px}.ds-gauge{position:relative;width:244px;height:238px;background:#1B1B1F;border-radius:13px}.ds-gauge-title{position:absolute;left:16px;top:12px;color:#AFB0BA;font-size:13px}.ds-arc{position:absolute;left:12px;top:38px;width:220px;height:116px;overflow:visible}.ds-track,.ds-fill{fill:none;stroke:#303035;stroke-width:9;stroke-linecap:round}.ds-fill{stroke:#82A8CA}.ds-gauge-value{color:#82A8CA;position:absolute;top:106px;left:12px;right:12px;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:500}.ds-gauge-value small{display:block;color:#AFB0BA;font-size:12px;font-weight:400}.ds-gauge-reset{position:absolute;left:16px;bottom:35px;font-size:12px;color:#AFB0BA}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Token composition",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "token-composition",
      "description": "An 11 px pastel segmented bar with matching 8 px legend dots. Label–percentage groups wrap together; sample proportions are illustrative.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-example\"><section class=\"ds-composition\"><div class=\"ds-composition-title\">Token 构成 · 示例</div><div class=\"ds-token-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ds-cache\"></i><i class=\"ds-input-part\"></i><i class=\"ds-output\"></i></div><div class=\"ds-token-legend\"><span class=\"ds-pair\"><span>缓存读取</span><b>80%</b></span><span class=\"ds-pair\"><span>普通输入</span><b>15%</b></span><span class=\"ds-pair\"><span>输出</span><b>5%</b></span></div></section></div>",
      "css": ".ds-example{display:inline-block;background:#101012;color:#F0F0F3;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei UI','Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:13px;}.ds-composition{background:#1B1B1F;border-radius:13px;padding:12px 16px 14px;max-width:390px;min-width:240px}.ds-composition-title{color:#AFB0BA;font-size:12px}.ds-token-bar{display:flex;gap:4px;height:11px;background:#303035;border-radius:5.5px;margin:15px 0}.ds-cache{flex:80;background:#BEA7FF}.ds-input-part{flex:15;background:#56CCF3}.ds-output{flex:5;background:#F8D36A}.ds-token-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;column-gap:20px;row-gap:8px;font-size:11px}.ds-pair{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap;color:#AFB0BA}.ds-pair b{color:#F0F0F3;font-weight:400}.ds-token-bar i{border-radius:5.5px}.ds-pair:before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;align-self:center;background:#BEA7FF}.ds-pair:nth-child(2):before{background:#56CCF3}.ds-pair:nth-child(3):before{background:#F8D36A}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Request ledger",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "request-ledger",
      "description": "Native QTableWidget and delegate translated for the panel. Centered row hierarchy, independent columns, measured numbers, horizontal overflow; the sample is synthetic.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-example\"><div class=\"ds-ledger-wrap\"><table class=\"ds-ledger\" aria-label=\"合成请求示例\"><thead><tr><th>用户请求 / 发起时间</th><th>模型</th><th>档位</th><th>API 等价</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr tabindex=\"0\" aria-selected=\"true\"><td>输入预览原文（示例）<small>09/08 20:51:03 · 2 次调用</small></td><td>多模型（2）<small>模型 A / 模型 B</small></td><td>Mixed</td><td>—</td><td class=\"ds-running\">回复中</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-example{display:inline-block;background:#101012;color:#F0F0F3;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei UI','Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:13px;}.ds-ledger-wrap{max-width:720px;overflow:auto}.ds-ledger{border-collapse:collapse;background:#101012;color:#F0F0F3;min-width:650px;font-size:12px}.ds-ledger th{padding:12px 9px;color:#AFB0BA;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;text-align:center}.ds-ledger td{height:58px;padding:0 9px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #303037;white-space:nowrap}.ds-ledger small{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:#AFB0BA;font-size:11px}.ds-ledger tr[aria-selected=true]{background:#2A2A32}.ds-ledger tbody tr:hover{background:#292930}.ds-ledger tbody tr:focus-visible{outline:none;background:#2A2A32}.ds-running{color:#58E8A0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "C · Quiet analytical workspace",
    "overview": "C is a quiet analytical workspace for sustained desktop use. An inset canvas and full-height navigation frame the data; compact quota summaries, measured typography, restrained chart colors, and daily activity keep the next comparison easy to find. This is the implemented Windows/PySide6 visual system.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "A continuous desktop workspace with a persistent sidebar.",
      "Tonal surfaces, compact controls, and inspectable records."
    ],
    "rules": [
      "Overview, Trends, and Logs default to Today; hourly chart buckets apply to Today. Explicit selections and date drilldowns take precedence.",
      "The overview five-hour quota, weekly quota, and Token composition share the row equally after gaps; keep each label beside its percentage when wrapping.",
      "Use a single coral-price/mint-Token plot with both zero-based axes. In the combined view, Token headroom is 2.2× peak and price headroom 1.12×; labelled scales remain truthful and crossings are allowed. Token-only restores normal scaling. Use faint fills and clear pastel Token composition with matching legend dots.",
      "Add directional percentage changes beneath overview metrics and the Trends chart, comparing against a complete preceding local-time unit (yesterday or full preceding 7/30 days). Apply model filtering to both windows; preserve missing-history, zero-baseline, incomplete-price and sync states.",
      "Keep subscription current data and cycle history in one continuous scrolling page. Date pickers use aligned fields and an isolated native-calendar style that displays all six weeks, with working navigation and keyboard selection.",
      "Overview metric cards omit bottom annotation lines. Home quota bars are 11 px high with rounded ends; their fill color interpolates red/yellow/green with 0/50/75% remaining, holding bright mint green above 75%. Unknown quota remains neutral. Keep chart points visible without hover and list Price before Total Token in the tooltip.",
      "Keep request details in a permanent 260–320 px right pane with a 20 px gap; preserve side-by-side geometry at narrow widths using left-table horizontal scrolling. Initially show a click-to-select hint. Only row clicks or keyboard activation show content; pointer motion and outside clicks do not change it. Refresh and filters preserve the selected table ID and detail scroll while the row remains on the current page, otherwise clear to the hint. Escape clears selection without hiding the pane.",
      "Use a 20 px semibold session title as the fixed preview heading, visibly larger than the message body and preserved through theme changes. The scrolling sequence is the bold question (up to three actual lines), an extra [image] x N line, API/usage summary, reply, Turn/Session IDs, then model × count and summed call prices. Combine mixed tiers, preserve missing prices, and remove member pagination. Use a raised charcoal or white inspector surface distinct from the ledger.",
      "Request Logs groups the table and pagination in one rounded surface card with aligned edges; filters stay above, and the technical aggregation footer is omitted.",
      "Append the Chinese weekday to local reset dates across overview, subscription, history, reset-credit deadlines and all floating styles. Narrow floating metadata wraps at a measured height. Subscription gauges use up to 200 px diameter, 9 px strokes and 34 px values.",
      "Begin weekly projection at a 2 percentage-point quota change. Valid reference prices participate with a reference-estimate status; missing prices still prevent projection. Omit the explanation to the right of the estimate summary.",
      "Place page vertical scrollbars 9 px from the canvas border and the inspector scrollbar 5 px from its border; preserve inner text spacing and usable dragging.",
      "Running request status uses vivid green and 13 px bold type, with at least 4.5:1 contrast on ordinary, hovered and selected rows. Overview quota high colors are brighter mint greens independent of status text ink.",
      "Use one centered six-column pricing table, grouping each model as API Base followed by Standard/long-context/Fast derived rows. Do not split into two section headings. Show conditions on two lines; use 50 px rows and 4 px vertical / 8 px horizontal cell padding. All edits target the selected model's Standard base, and all fee displays use the backend-derived catalog. Preserve sufficient unit-price precision and unknown values.",
      "Use the concise sidebar labels 概览、日志、用量、订阅、定价、设置 without changing page identities or full page headings.",
      "Synchronize framed Windows caption dark mode, background and text with the app theme after theme changes, native-handle creation and show. Exclude custom floating windows and menus.",
      "Derive prices from ordinary-context Standard API bases only. Codex Fast is 2.5x for Astra/GPT-5.6/GPT-5.5 and 2x for GPT-5.4. Above 272K input, GPT-5.6/GPT-5.5/GPT-5.4 apply 2x input/cache and 1.5x output; Astra has no extra long-context multiplier. Cache creation uses ordinary input rates without a write premium. Version the policy and revalue all historical fee caches consistently."
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve label–percentage pairs, complete numeric values, independent record fields, and visible freshness or missing-data states.",
      "Do keep subscription profiles user-entered and blank by default; label synthetic previews and retain API-equivalent units without “估算” badges. Internal estimated-price flags remain intact.",
      "Do retain Qt keyboard focus, Ctrl+K search, scrolling, scaling, and the existing background-worker lifecycle."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't infer renewal dates, credit deadlines, zero usage, Standard tier, or per-call timing from absent data.",
      "Don't replace the full sidebar with a narrow icon rail or make the floating surface follow the main-window theme."
    ]
  }
}
